  {"id":"english-cloze-019","type":"cloze","subject":"english","difficulty":3,"grade":9,"knowledgeTags":["完形填空"],"question":"Life is like a (1). We may meet with difficulties on the way. When we face difficulties, we should never (2). As the saying goes, \"Where there is a (3), there is a way.\" I always keep this (4) my mind. No matter how (5) the problem is, I will try my best to (6) it. I believe my efforts will (7) off one day. Success belongs to those who never (8).","options":[{"label":"A","text":"A. journey; give up; will; in; hard; solve; pay; give up"},{"label":"B","text":"B. race; lose heart; way; in; difficult; face; turn; stop"},{"label":"C","text":"C. book; run away; storm; on; serious; overcome; bring; quit"},{"label":"D","text":"D. dream; fall down; hope; at; big; solve; pay; win"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"life is like a journey人生如旅；never give up永不放弃；where there is a will there is a way有志者事竟成；keep in my mind铭记在心；no matter how hard无论多难；solve it解决它；pay off回报；success belongs to those who never give up成功属于永不放弃的人。"}
